Finset.sigmaLift.eq_1.code:
Finset.sigmaLift.eq_1.{u_1, u_2, u_3, u_4} {ι : Type u_1} {α : ι → Type u_2} {β : ι → Type u_3} {γ : ι → Type u_4}
